    "book": "Breaking Bread Digital Music Library",
    "tags": [
      "Breaking Bread Digital Music Library",
      "Palm Sunday"
    ],
    "category": "Breaking Bread Digital Music Library / Palm Sunday",
    "lyrics": "1. Rejoice, daughter of Zion, in the One who brings great joy! Sing praise, children of Judah, for the Lord is close at hand! [R.]\n\n2. Rejoice, all who are thirsting for the streams of living joy! Sing praise, children of Judah, for the Lord is close at hand! [R.]\n\n3. Rejoice, all who are longing to behold the face of God! Sing praise, children of Judah, for the Lord is close at hand! [R.]\n\n4. Rejoice, all who are searching for the truth of holy light! Sing praise, children of Judah, for the Lord is close at hand! [R.]\n\n5. Rejoice, all who are hoping [R.]\n\n6. Rejoice, all who are waiting for the dawn of heaven's light! Sing praise, children of Judah, for the Lord is close at hand! [R.]\n\n7. Rejoice, all who are calling on the name of God on high! Sing praise, children of Judah, for the Lord is close at hand! [R.]\n\n8. Rejoice, all who are hungry for the taste of living bread! Sing praise, children of Judah, for the Lord is close at hand! [R.]\n\n[R.]\nO blest is he, O blest is he Sing praise, children of Judah, for the Lord is close at hand!",
    "translations": {},
    "firstLine": "Rejoice, daughter of Zion, in the One who brings great joy! Sing praise, children of Judah, for the Lord is close at hand! [R.]",
